{#
mail/_unsubscribe_button.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The Unsubscribe button at the right-hand end of the reading pane's toolbar.

Variables:
  options   UnsubscribeOptions   what the sender offered (see UnsubscribeResolver)
  account   Account|null         the mailbox the conversation is in, so a mailto
                                 request is written FROM the subscribed address

One button, three behaviours, chosen in the order that asks the least of the
reader:

  one-click   plMail makes the request itself, after a confirmation that names
              the host it will contact. Nothing of the sender's is opened.
  page        the sender's own unsubscribe page, in a new tab. plMail cannot
              finish a form on someone else's site, so it does not pretend to.
  mailto      the composer, pre-filled. Sending is still the reader's click.

`rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"` on the page link: the address came from a
mail header, so the tab it opens must not be able to reach back into this one
(`noopener`) and must not be told which mailbox the click came from
(`noreferrer`).
#}
{% set buttonClass = 'ml-auto flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 h-8 px-3 rounded-full text-xs font-medium
                      text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-hover border border-line transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}

{% if options.oneClickUrl is not null %}
    <button type="button"
            data-controller="mail--unsubscribe"
            data-action="click->mail--unsubscribe#oneClick"
            data-mail--unsubscribe-url-value="{{ path('app_mail_unsubscribe', { id: options.messageId }) }}"
            data-mail--unsubscribe-confirm-value="{{ 'unsubscribe.confirm'|trans({ '%host%': options.oneClickHost }) }}"
            data-mail--unsubscribe-sent-value="{{ 'unsubscribe.sent'|trans }}"
            data-mail--unsubscribe-failed-value="{{ 'unsubscribe.failed'|trans }}"
            title="{{ 'unsubscribe.title_one_click'|trans({ '%host%': options.oneClickHost }) }}"
            class="{{ buttonClass }} disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-wait">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-ban text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{ 'unsubscribe.button'|trans }}
    </button>
{% elseif options.webUrl is not null %}
    <a href="{{ options.webUrl }}"
       target="_blank"
       rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
       title="{{ 'unsubscribe.title_page'|trans }}"
       class="{{ buttonClass }}">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-ban text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{ 'unsubscribe.button'|trans }}
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[9px] text-ink-faint" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </a>
{% else %}
    <a href="{{ path('app_compose_new', {
           to:      options.mailtoAddress,
           subject: options.mailtoSubject,
           body:    options.mailtoBody,
           account: account is not null ? account.id : null,
       }) }}"
       data-turbo-frame="compose_dock"
       title="{{ 'unsubscribe.title_mailto'|trans({ '%address%': options.mailtoAddress }) }}"
       class="{{ buttonClass }}">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-ban text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {{ 'unsubscribe.button'|trans }}
    </a>
{% endif %}
